        "entities": {
          "urls": [
            {
              "description": "Demoralizing as it has been, the 2026 election season in the United States has nonetheless been quite valuable in revealing the contradictions in how reactionaries on the right understand matters of sex and gender. For example, most people on the far right insist that biological sex constitutes a strict binary, sometimes referring to the Book of Genesis for their backing: ‘male and female He made them.’ However, the people who insist so loudly upon a strict binary in matters of biology prove eager to create exceptions to this binary, to dub someone not a ‘real man’ or a ‘real woman.’ Texan…",
